  "_notes": [
    "label_mm is the size printed under each tag: the full tag including its white border (the dotted cut box, 10 x 10 cells).",
    "black_mm is the edge of the black square (8 x 8 cells = 0.8 x label). This is what pose estimation uses.",
    "print_scale is per sheet. After printing, measure a black square (or the 100 mm bar on set 2) and set print_scale = measured / expected, e.g. 99 mm bar -> 0.99.",
    "Every ID 0-86 exists exactly once across both sheets. Floor tags and object tags must use different IDs.",
    "Cut along the dotted box: keep the white border, it is part of the tag."
  ],
